  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First public preview release. Introduces config-driven build via alwasp.json with apps/tests\n      inventory, profiles, targets, and build manifests. Adds build-time app.json transformations\n      (versioning, Application Insights, resource exposure policy), git-based change detection\n      (--changed-since), and the alwasp version apply command. Adds alwasp init and\n      alwasp config validate commands with JSON schema support. Removes unreliable workspace build\n      apps/tests heuristic commands. See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
